    <Description>This macro is for a movement technique called "ras strafe". It is used by pros in fights to avoid getting hit by their enemies. Make sure that "scroll wheel" up is "move forward" and "scroll wheel down" is "jump" in the Apex settings.Set a hotkey of your choice to this macro.
Practice it in "fireing Range" first befor "pubs" or "ranked"
Enjoy!</Description>
